xibly form either T7,T8,T9 chow + T7 for pair, or T7,T7 pair + T8,T9 waiting for T7 to complete another chow. The W9 pair has limited value since I already have a Character suit meld, and focusing on developing the Bamboo suit sequence gives me better winning chances.\n\nAnswer: Play W9"}
